      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks again to you and the Rust Syndicate for\nyour help the other day.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Remember that Gengar I said I’d look after?\nWell...I haven’t seen it for a while.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s a wild Pokémon, so I know it’s gonna come\nand go as it pleases...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I’d gotten used to having it around. And, if\nI’m being honest, I’m kinda worried about it.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know it’s a weird ask, but do you think you could\nhelp me look for Gengar? It’d mean a lot.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’ll need help from a Ghost-type expert too.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLet’s go see if Gwynn from the Fist of Justice can\nlend a hand! She should be at the dojo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...So you need my help.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E0053006F00200079006F00750020006E0065006500640020006D0079002000680065006C0070002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll do it on one condition.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C00200064006F0020006900740020006F006E0020006F006E006500200063006F006E0064006900740069006F006E002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Battle me.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006100740074006C00650020006D0065002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re going down!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007520190072006500200067006F0069006E006700200064006F0077006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I don’t feel like it...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200064006F006E201900740020006600650065006C0020006C0069006B0065002000690074002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then you deserve to be stuck.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065006E00200079006F00750020006400650073006500720076006500200074006F00200062006500200073007400750063006B002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Revenge will be mine.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006500760065006E00670065002000770069006C006C0020006200650020006D0069006E0065002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You really are strong...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007200650061006C006C007900200061007200650020007300740072006F006E0067002E002E002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You. Explain why you need my help. And keep it\nbrief.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002E0020004500780070006C00610069006E002000770068007900200079006F00750020006E0065006500640020006D0079002000680065006C0070002E00200041006E00640020006B006500650070002000690074000A00620072006900650066002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hm... I see why you’re concerned.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D002E002E002E002000490020007300650065002000770068007900200079006F007520190072006500200063006F006E006300650072006E00650064002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Still, now we have an idea of the sort of Gengar\nwe’re dealing with.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300740069006C006C002C0020006E006F00770020007700650020006800610076006500200061006E002000690064006500610020006F0066002000740068006500200073006F007200740020006F0066002000470065006E006700610072000A007700652019007200650020006400650061006C0069006E006700200077006900740068002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chandelure should be able to sense where it is.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300680061006E00640065006C007500720065002000730068006F0075006C0064002000620065002000610062006C006500200074006F002000730065006E00730065002000770068006500720065002000690074002000690073002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But know this—some Ghost-type Pokémon like to\nsettle in...and others would much rather roam.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So don’t set your hopes too high.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F00200064006F006E20190074002000730065007400200079006F0075007200200068006F00700065007300200074006F006F00200068006900670068002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’ve been warned.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00752019007600650020006200650065006E0020007700610072006E00650064002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I get it. I just want to make sure Gengar’s OK.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006700650074002000690074002E002000490020006A007500730074002000770061006E007400200074006F0020006D0061006B006500200073007500720065002000470065006E006700610072201900730020004F004B002E001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you sense anything, Chandelure?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
