      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The Galerie de la Lune? How bizarre...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 4892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065002000470061006C00650072006900650020006400650020006C00610020004C0075006E0065003F00200048006F0077002000620069007A0061007200720065002E002E002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So Gengar’s developed a taste for haute couture,\nis that it?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 4980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F002000470065006E0067006100722019007300200064006500760065006C006F0070006500640020006100200074006100730074006500200066006F007200200068006100750074006500200063006F00750074007500720065002C000A0069007300200074006800610074002000690074003F001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If so, it should have gone to the Passage Ombragé.\nMy favorite clothing store, Wisp, is there.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 5112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well...the Galerie de la Lune it is, then!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 5312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C006C002E002E002E007400680065002000470061006C00650072006900650020006400650020006C00610020004C0075006E0065002000690074002000690073002C0020007400680065006E0021001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This does feel like a place where Gengar might\nlike to lurk...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 5408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680069007300200064006F006500730020006600650065006C0020006C0069006B00650020006100200070006C006100630065002000770068006500720065002000470065006E0067006100720020006D0069006700680074000A006C0069006B006500200074006F0020006C00750072006B002E002E002E001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 5544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You know what to do, Chandelure.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 5556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020006B006E006F00770020007700680061007400200074006F00200064006F002C0020004300680061006E00640065006C007500720065002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Shaaa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 5632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006800610061006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gehe?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 5648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047006500680065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Is this your Gengar?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 5660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900730020007400680069007300200079006F00750072002000470065006E006700610072003F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No... Its cry is different.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 5712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002E002E002E0020004900740073002000630072007900200069007300200064006900660066006500720065006E0074002E001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There you are, Gengar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 5776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800650072006500200079006F00750020006100720065002C002000470065006E00670061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s head home, shall we? Tonight I think I’ll\nmake that stew you like!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 5824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00650074201900730020006800650061006400200068006F006D0065002C0020007300680061006C006C002000770065003F00200054006F006E0069006700680074002000490020007400680069006E006B002000492019006C006C000A006D0061006B0065002000740068006100740020007300740065007700200079006F00750020006C0069006B006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gehehe!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 5972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470065006800650068006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s try again, Chandelure. People are counting\non our help.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 5988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0065007420190073002000740072007900200061006700610069006E002C0020004300680061006E00640065006C007500720065002E002000500065006F0070006C0065002000610072006500200063006F0075006E00740069006E0067000A006F006E0020006F00750072002000680065006C0070002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s OK... Let’s call off the search.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 6120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800610074201900730020004F004B002E002E002E0020004C0065007420190073002000630061006C006C0020006F0066006600200074006800650020007300650061007200630068002E001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you and Chandelure are having trouble finding\nGengar, I don’t think there’s much hope.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 6208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 6396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750074002E002E002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I should’ve asked Gengar to be my partner while I\nhad the chance...and now it’s too late.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 6420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I hadn’t even realized how much I enjoyed having\nGengar around until it left.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 6608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But...that’s life, I guess.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThanks so much for helping me search for Gengar\nanyway. I really appreciate it.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 6772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 115
    },
    {
      "displayText": "After all that...we couldn’t help him...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 7004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006600740065007200200061006C006C00200074006800610074002E002E002E0077006500200063006F0075006C0064006E20190074002000680065006C0070002000680069006D002E002E002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Heh. It’s funny to think about Gengar having a\nlittle shopping spree and trying on outfits...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 7096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿N",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 7292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF004E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Look, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>! Gengar came\nback!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 7304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD060000004C006F006F006B002C002000100002010000000021002000470065006E006700610072002000630061006D0065000A006200610063006B0021001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Geh...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 80,
      "offsetInSection": 7380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700650068002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It may wander off again, I know. And maybe\nthat’ll be the last time I ever see it...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBut for now, I’m gonna go all in on appreciating\nthe precious time I get to spend with Gengar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 7396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 187
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t worry—I made sure to tell Gwynn that\nGengar came back safe and sound.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 7772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gegeh...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 7932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470065006700650068002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    }
